#: ../../tools/open_meteo_tools.rst:32 7ea95e5846a84697a132d1849a81465d
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for city/location coordinates using Open-Meteo's "
"free geocoding API. Returns latitude, longitude, country, timezone, "
"elevation, and population for matching locations. Use this to get "
"coordinates before calling OpenMeteo\\_get\\_weather\\_forecast or "
"OpenMeteo\\_get\\_historical\\_weather. Covers 300,000+ cities worldwide."
msgstr ""

