"(e.g., "
"'temperature\\_2m\\_max,temperature\\_2m\\_min,precipitation\\_sum,wind\\_speed\\_10m\\_max,sunshine\\_duration')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_tools.rst:129 58368fc747c34bf282ca2af4e99161ff
msgid ""
